<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 4: </span>Fine-tuning results of Mistral-7B under the diminished overlap setup. We first fine-tune the models using TULU-v2-mix, and then conduct additional SFT using both the small UltraFeedback demonstration subset and an additional 40k examples from TULU-v2-mix to refine the model.
</figcaption>
